invariant: INV-25
file: webpki_time.c
catches: webpki_time_test
builds: bin/webpki_time_test
reason: webpki_read_time takes the tag's fixed length for the field's
  length and never compares it with the length octet, so a Time
  declaring 14 octets and carrying a valid 13-octet UTCTime parses and
  leaves a byte inside the Validity. test/webpki_time_test.c's length
  pair objects.

--- old
    if (!x509_read_len(r, &len) || len != body_len) {
--- new
    if (!x509_read_len(r, &len)) {
